# Ouroboroid: "At the beginning of combat on your turn, put X +1/+1 counters on each creature you control, where X is
# Ouroboroid's power." Turn one it is cast off Black Lotus and a Forest beside an Ornithopter, and at that combat X is 1:
# Ouroboroid 2/4, Ornithopter 1/3. On turn three X is 2, so Ouroboroid is 4/6 and Ornithopter 3/5.

